Build a bounded JSONL plan of idempotent FalkorDB graph writes

Usage: aws-inventory graph-export [OPTIONS] --scan-id <SCAN_ID>

Options:
      --db <DB>            [default: inventory.sqlite]
      --scan-id <SCAN_ID>  
      --graph <GRAPH>      [default: aws_inventory]
      --output <OUTPUT>    [default: graph.jsonl]
      --allow-partial      
  -h, --help               Print help
